    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, awa ashakama muZiyona nakudiwujola; ashakama kumpidi yaSamariya nákubula kwakama! Amayala atúumbakana amunyuza yalema, kwenzaŋa akwamutaŋa waIsarela! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitenu kuKalane, mutali; mufumi nawa kwenoku muyi kuHamati muneni; mukunkumuki nawa kuGati wawaFwilistinu. Komana wena diwu anabadiki mawantawa? Komana ŋinza yawu yinabadiki yenu kutoha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwashinjikaŋa ifuku datama kwakulehi, mwaleteshaŋa itanda dandombu kwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwakamaŋa hatudidi twambiŋa yanjamba, mwadolojolaŋa hatudidi twenu, mwadyaloŋa anyana kanyikoku akusakula hamukanka, ninyana kaŋombi akusakula mwitaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwembaŋa tumina twaŋoma twakwimba nayisanji, mwadisoŋelaŋa yisanji yenu neyi Davidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwanwinaŋa vinyu muyikashi yantentu, mwawayaloŋa manji chiŋa wowu abadika kulema; kwinza chamonaŋa Yosefu ihuŋu himwaneŋaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu mwakaya muwukoli hamu nanawa akasambilaŋahu dehi kuya muwukoli, nikuluŋa kwenu kumwadiŋi nakudolojola kwakahita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi wamazaza nindi, Mwanta Yehova nadisanyiki yomweni, nindi, Kulema kwaYakoba nakutiyi kumuchima bwi, matalindi awanta nayiheli mbe; dichi nimukala niyuma yejima yidumu nakayihana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwitala dimu mwakashala antu ikumi, akafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakumunyamunawu muntu kudi kawusoku windi mukwakumushita kulonda edishi mafwaha mwitala, wukumwila mukwawu wudi mukachi ketala nindi, Omu muwudi munashali mukwawu? Yena wukwila nindi, Nehi. Wukwila nindi, Shi-shi! Bayi tutena ijina daYehovaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, muloŋa Yehova nahoshi dehi nindi, Matala amaneni chiŋa akayihumona humu-humu, tumatala twanyanya, chiŋa akatusandola mwa-mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuwalu twendi lufuchi helola? Muntu adimuhu naŋombi? Mwaka mubalumunaŋa wuŋaji wikali ndulu, ninyikabu yakuloŋa yili mutondu walula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwazaŋalalaŋa nachuma chamukunkulwayi, mwelaŋa nenu, ŋi nseŋu tudi naju hitunajimoni nanichi chitunajikishi etu awenuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa tiyenu, enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, nakayinyamwina muza, wakayikabisha chakufumisha kuwiŋililu wakuHamati ndo nikukakaloŋa kakuchana. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova, Nzambi wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
